## Decisions Made

- **Measurement first, then fix** (Director q1a: "measuring is the base of fixing") —
  every fix this session was chosen to make the autonomy metric readable before polishing.
- **Billing breaker splits by governance exemption, self-clearing** — the Director is
  exempt (she is the escalation target); the first COMPLETED job clears the wall, so there
  is no reset flag to forget.
- **Ghost ≠ generation failure** — reaped (marker) and hand-swept (no completed_at/no error)
  rows are excluded from `failure_count` so the reconciler's `recovery_cap` isn't tripped
  by runs that never executed.
- **`jobs-stale-reaper` over keeping the hand-run script** (q5a) — a code function removes
  the unplanned Director touch AND the ledger dishonesty; modeled on `pa-orphaned-awaiting-sweep`.
- **One shared persistence hook, not 7 copies** — but existing 6 collapse on-touch, no mass
  rewrite (anti-additivity).
- **Two sessions, one tree, split by planet** — factory here, growth next door; PLAN.md
  master-only; don't cross-edit.

